{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：00:49 2026-10-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：00:49 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：00:49 2026-10-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"警聯同入境荃灣掃黃拘捕7名內地女 年齡31至47歲。警方提供\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36b7a891b3d13c046ee577950318418b/2026-10/Anti-vice_SDS_2_TWDIST.jpeg\"/><p>荃灣警區特別職務隊人員聯同相關部門，根據線報及經深入調查後，昨日（21日）展開代號「嶺馬」（LANDMASTER）的掃黃行動。</p><p>行動中，人員於川龍街、眾安街、海壩街及二陂坊一帶，共拘捕7名內地女子，年齡介乎為31至47歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。</p><p>所有被捕人正被扣留調查，稍後將交相關部門跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T17:01:01.282654+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:49:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T20:54:25.878103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T16:57:43.690113+00:00","content_hash":"d8181506b956dcdf26b2f77b52d6f126da9b6f904dabb5633cca0b8096a5da22","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}